HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY   u9ung203m  u9ung204m  u9ungf03m  u9ungf04m  u9ur4907m                 HISTORY   u9ur4908m  u9ur4909m  u9ur490am  u9ur5107m  u9ur5108m                 HISTORY   u9ur5109m  u9ur510am  u9ur5207m  u9ur5208m  u9ur5209m                 HISTORY   u9ur520am  u9ur5307m  u9ur5308m  u9ur5309m  u9ur530am                 HISTORY   ub0m1007m  ub0m1009m  ub0m100am  ub0m1107m  ub0m1109m                 HISTORY   ub0m110am  ub0m1207m  ub0m1208m  ub0m1209m  ub0m120am                 HISTORY   ub0m1307m  ub0m130am  ub0m1407m  ub0m1408m  ub0m1409m                 HISTORY   ub0m140am  ub0m1507m  ub0m1508m  ub0m1509m  ub0m150am                 HISTORY   ub0m1607m  ub0m1608m  ub0m1609m  ub0m160am  ub0m1707m                 HISTORY   ub0m1709m  ub0m170am  ub0m1807m  ub0m1808m  ub0m1809m                 HISTORY   ub0m180am  ub0m1907m  ub0m1908m  ub0m190am  ub0m2007m                 HISTORY   ub0m2008m  ub0m200am  ub0m2107m  ub0m2108m  ub0m2109m                 HISTORY   ub0m2207m  ub0m2209m  ub0m220am  ub0m2307m  ub0m2308m                 HISTORY   ub0m2309m  ub0m230am  ub0m2407m  ub0m2408m  ub0m2409m                 HISTORY   ub0m240am  ub0m2607m  ub0m2608m  ub0m2609m  ub0m260am                 HISTORY   ub0m2707m  ub0m2708m  ub0m2709m  ub0m2808m  ub0m2809m                 HISTORY   ub0m280am  ub0m2907m  ub0m2908m  ub0m2909m  ub0m290am                 HISTORY   ub0m3007m  ub0m3008m  ub0m3009m  ub0m300am  ub0m3105m                 HISTORY   ub0m3106m  ub0m3107m  ub0m3108m  ub0m3206m  ub0m3207m                 HISTORY   ub0m3208m  ub0m3305m  ub0m3306m  ub0m3307m  ub0m3308m                 HISTORY   ub0m340am  ub0m3505m  ub0m3506m  ub0m3507m  ub0m3508m                 HISTORY   ub0pn203m  ub0pn204m  ub0pnf03m  ub0pnf04m  ub0po203m                 HISTORY   ub0po204m  ub0pof03m  ub0pof04m  ub0pp203m  ub0pp204m                 HISTORY   ub0ppf03m  ub0pq203m  ub0pq204m  ub0pqf03m  ub0pqf04m                 HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY   The raw images were retrieved from the archive. All 4 CCDs were       HISTORY   recalibrated using CALWP2 Version 2.5.4, with mask, atod, and         HISTORY   blevcorr set to PERFORM. Only images with WF4 BIASEVEN > 250          HISTORY   were used, so as to avoid large gain corrections.                     HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY   The STSDAS wfpc "mkdark" task (identical to a version of              HISTORY   "crrej" previously used to make reference bias files) was             HISTORY   used to combine the calibrated frames and remove cosmic rays.         HISTORY   The task was run with four iterations, using sigmas set to            HISTORY   6,5,5,and 4; Pixels are rejected if they are N sigma above or         1HISTORY   below the initial guess image. The first initial guess image         HISTORY   was taken to be the median of the stack; subsequent iterations        HISTORY   use the computed average image as the initial guess. In               HISTORY   addition, pixels within 1 pixel of a rejected pixel (in a '+'         HISTORY   pattern) were discarded if they deviated by more than 6,5,5,          HISTORY   and 4 sigmas, respectively for each iteration. Pixels using           HISTORY   less than 100 input images were marked in the DQF.                    HISTORY   On-orbit file was generated and formatted for CDBS installation on    HISTORY   June 19, 2009 at STScI.                                               HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY   Superbias for observations taken after December 3, 2007.              PEDIGREE= 'INFLIGHT 03/12/07 11/05/09'                                          USEAFTER= 'December 3 2007 00:00:00'                                            DESCRIP = 'Dec 2007 - May 2009 yearly superbias'                                